      - generic: 0/178 已安装\n      - generic: academic-paper-expert\n      - generic: \"|\"\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: ad-copywriter\n      - generic: 广告创意写作与优化技能，覆盖标题、描述、正文及完整广告方案的生成与迭代，适用于Google Ads、Meta、LinkedIn、TikTok、Twitter/X等主流付费广告平台。当用户需要撰写广告文案、进行创意生成、标题撰写，或请求批量生产广告变体、基于数据进行创意测试与效果优化时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: ad-creative\n      - generic: When the user wants to generate, iterate, or scale ad creative — headlines, descriptions, primary text, or full ad variations — for any paid advertising platform. Also use when the user mentions 'ad copy variations,' 'ad creative,' 'generate headlines,' 'RSA headlines,' 'bulk ad copy,' 'ad iterations,' 'creative testing,' 'ad performance optimization,' 'write me some ads,' 'Facebook ad copy,' 'Google ad headlines,' 'LinkedIn ad text,' or 'I need more ad variations.' Use this whenever someone needs to produce ad copy at scale or iterate on existing ads.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: agent-generator\n      - generic: Generate a complete Octopus Agent from a short natural-language brief. Use when creating, bootstrapping, or refining an Agent from a one-line description, role idea, use case, or persona concept; expands the brief into SOUL, ARM/tool groups, private_skills whitelist, permissions, behavior boundaries, default workflow, and setup_agent-ready configuration.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: agent-visual-kit\n      - generic: Metaskill workflow for generating Octopus Agent character artwork. Use when creating or regenerating Agent portraits, three-view character sheets, transparent-background standees, separate close-up avatars, or visual assets from HUD character profile data; constrains prompt assembly, generation, post-processing, quality checks, and retry reasons.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: agnes-image-generate\n      - generic: 使用火山引擎(火山方舟)或 Agnes AI 网关从文字描述生成图像。默认火山 doubao-seedream-5.0-lite（文生图+图生图），未配置火山 key 时自动回退 Agnes agnes-image-2.1-flash。当用户需要生成图片、插画或封面时调用此技能。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: agnes-video-generate\n      - generic: 使用火山引擎(火山方舟, doubao-seedance-1.5-pro)或 Agnes AI 网关异步提交视频生成任务。默认 wait=true 阻塞到完成并返回 video_url；也可 wait=false 立即返回 task_id，用 agnes-video-poll 查询进度。支持文字到视频、图像到视频(首帧/首尾帧)。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: agnes-video-poll\n      - generic: 查询视频生成任务的状态（火山 doubao-seedance 或 Agnes）。配合 agnes-video-generate（wait=false 异步提交）使用——后者返回 task_id 后，模型可在后续轮次用 task_id 调用本技能查看进度或获取 video_url。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: api-and-interface-design\n      - generic: Guides stable API and interface design. Use when designing APIs, module boundaries, or any public interface. Use when creating REST or GraphQL endpoints, defining type contracts between modules, or establishing boundaries between frontend and backend.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: api-doc-gen\n      - generic: 从 Flask、FastAPI、Express 或 Gin 等 Web 框架的源代码中自动扫描路由定义，生成符合 OpenAPI 3.0 / Swagger 规范的标准化 API 文档文件。当用户需要生成 API 文档、提到 OpenAPI、Swagger、接口文档、路由扫描或从代码自动提取接口信息时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: api-shape-explorer\n      - generic: Generate multiple radically different interface designs for a module using parallel sub-agents. Use when user wants to design an API, explore interface options, compare module shapes, or mentions \"design it twice\".\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: auto-hypothesis-test\n      - generic: Automatically selects and runs the right statistical test for your data — t-test, ANOVA, chi-square, Mann-Whitney, or others — and provides plain-language interpretations of the results. Triggered when you ask about group comparisons, significance, p-values, hypothesis testing, or mention specific tests like t-test, ANOVA, or chi-square.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: auto-stat-test\n      - generic: 自动执行统计检验，根据数据特征（组数、正态性、配对设计）智能选择 t 检验、卡方检验、ANOVA、Mann-Whitney U 等合适方法，并输出包含 p 值、效应量和通俗中文解读的完整报告。当用户需要进行假设检验、组间比较、显著性分析，或提及 t 检验、卡方、方差分析、p 值、配对检验、非参数检验等关键词时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: backend-building\n      - generic: Backend building that grafts tRPC + Drizzle ORM + Hono onto an existing webapp-building frontend. Supports incremental features (db, auth). Use when the user needs a backend, API, database, server, authentication, or wants to add tRPC/Drizzle to their webapp-building project. Requires webapp-building first.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: brand-name-forge\n      - generic: A systematic brand naming workshop that generates 8 distinct name candidates using classic methods like portmanteau and metaphor, each with meaning, rationale, and domain suggestions. Triggered when a user needs to name a product, service, or company, or asks for brand name ideas, brainstorming, or naming help.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: browse\n      - generic: Automate browser interactions via CLI commands to navigate web pages, extract data, take screenshots, fill forms, and interact with web apps. Supports remote sessions with CAPTCHA solving and anti-bot stealth for scraping protected sites. Trigger when the user asks to browse websites, scrape data, or automate clicks on any page.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: browser-testing-with-devtools\n      - generic: Tests in real browsers. Use when building or debugging anything that runs in a browser. Use when you need to inspect the DOM, capture console errors, analyze network requests, profile performance, or verify visual output with real runtime data via Chrome DevTools MCP.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: browser-use\n      - generic: Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots,\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: business-copy-expert\n      - generic: \"|\"\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: business-plan-ppt\n      - generic: 创建专业精美的投资路演PPT和商业计划书，风格参照中国创业公司融资路演材料，默认输出18页、白色背景搭配藏青色点缀的PPTX格式，也可导出PDF，支持中英文内容。当用户需要为投资人制作路演PPT、撰写商业计划书或融资方案、生成包含市场分析和财务预测的公司概览幻灯片，或提及创业融资/投资备忘录演示文稿时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: capability-evolver\n      - generic: GitHub API token for auto-issue reporting and releases.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: chart-gen\n      - generic: 从JSON数据生成高质量PNG/SVG图表图片，支持折线图、柱状图、面积图、散点图、K线图、饼图/环形图、热力图、多系列图和堆叠图等多种类型。适用于快速可视化数据、生成报告图表、绘制趋势变化等场景。当用户请求“生成图表”、“画个趋势图”、“做个柱状图”、“可视化这些数据”，或提供具体数据并要求“做成图表图片”、“导出为PNG”时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: chart-image\n      - generic: Generate publication-quality PNG chart images from data, supporting line, bar, area, candlestick, pie, and heatmap charts. Triggers when the user asks to visualize data, create a graph, plot a time series, or generate a chart for a report, alert, or dashboard. Runs as a lightweight, headless Node.js process without a browser.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: cn-finance-data\n      - generic: 通过 Tushare Pro 获取中国金融市场数据，覆盖 A 股、港股、美股、基金、期货、债券等 220+ 个数据接口，可查询股票行情、财务报表、指数成分、GDP/CPI 等宏观经济指标。当用户请求金融数据查询、股票历史行情、财务指标分析、宏观数据获取，或提及 Tushare、数据接口、量化数据源等关键词时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: code-arch-optimizer\n      - generic: 探索代码库，识别架构摩擦点，并通过“加深浅模块”来提升可测试性，最终输出包含多种接口设计方案的详细重构建议与GitHub Issue RFC。当用户希望改进架构、寻找重构机会、合并紧耦合模块，或让代码库更易于AI导航和理解时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: code-mentor\n      - generic: Comprehensive AI programming tutor offering interactive lessons, code reviews, debugging help, algorithm practice, and project guidance for Python and JavaScript. Triggers when users ask to learn a language, debug code, review their work, practice algorithms, prepare for interviews, or build a project.\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: code-quality\n      - generic: 代码质量技能，包含代码审查、重构、性能优化、最佳实践检查。在代码审查或重构时调用。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: code-safety-audit\n      - generic: 扫描代码安全漏洞，检测依赖漏洞、密钥泄露和OWASP安全模式。当用户提到安全扫描、漏洞检测、依赖审计、密钥泄露、API key、OWASP、npm audit、pip-audit或SQL注入/XSS等关键词时触发。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: code-vuln-audit\n      - generic: \"Scan code for security issues: dependency vulnerabilities (npm/pip audit), secret leaks (regex and entropy analysis), and OWASP anti-patterns like SQL injection, XSS, or command injection. Use when the user mentions security scans, vulnerability detection, secret leaks, API keys, OWASP, npm audit, pip-audit, hardcoded passwords, or code security checks.\"\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: competitive-seo-intel\n      - generic: 深入分析竞争对手的SEO与GEO策略，涵盖关键词排名、内容打法、外链画像、技术SEO评估及AI引用模式，识别超越对手的市场机会，并提供竞品分析模板、战斗卡片等参考。当用户询问“分析竞品SEO”、“竞争对手为什么排名更高”、“竞品关键词和外链分析”或“内容策略对比”时触发。如需专项分析，可使用content-gap-analysis进行内容差距分析，或使用backlink-analyzer进行外链深度分析。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: content-writing\n      - generic: \"|\"\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-3d-animation\n      - generic: 把故事创意转成角色、场景、镜头、动作与合成一致的 3D 动画短片制作方案。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-anime-pv\n      - generic: 为动画、游戏或虚拟 IP 设计短篇 PV，包括卖点提炼、分镜、节奏、音乐方向与生成执行清单。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-anime-style-forge\n      - generic: 将角色与场景锻造成一致的原创动画视觉体系，覆盖线条、比例、上色、材质和镜头规则。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-audiobook\n      - generic: 将书稿组织为多角色有声书制作包，覆盖脚本清理、选角、表演、环境声、章节与质检。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-beat-sync-edit\n      - generic: 按音乐结构、拍点与情绪变化设计镜头卡点、速度变化和声音衔接。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-brand-film\n      - generic: 把品牌策略和产品卖点转成可执行的品牌宣传片、产品广告与多渠道视觉资产。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-brand-flow-mg\n      - generic: 基于品牌标志、IP 与主题制作流线引导、节点连接和标志收束的 MG 动效。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-broll-planner\n      - generic: 把口播逐字稿拆成可审片的 B-roll 镜头、素材来源、时长和覆盖关系。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-character-performance\n      - generic: 根据角色图、剧本与情绪设计自然的微表情、视线、呼吸和肢体表演提示。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-cinematic-shot-cards\n      - generic: 为叙事场景生成可执行的电影镜头卡与角色卡，明确机位、焦段、调度、光线和连续性。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-cinematic-style-extractor\n      - generic: 从电影名称、剧照或参考片段提炼可复用的构图、镜头、光色、材质和声音规则，并生成原创执行方案。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-comfyui-workflow\n      - generic: 使用 Octopus ComfyUI 工作流桥接诊断、编辑、保存和运行本机节点工作流，并核对真实生成结果；适用于文生图、图生图、放大和用户已安装扩展支持的图像、视频或音频流程。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-course-landing-page\n      - generic: 将课程定位、学习成果和课程结构设计成信息清楚、可转化且可实现的技能课程详情页。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-digital-product-film\n      - generic: 把真实产品页面、交互路径和动效参考转成准确呈现界面的电影感数字产品宣传片。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-director-stage\n      - generic: 使用 Octopus 3D 导演台编排角色、场景、机位、姿态、走位和运镜；适用于分镜预演、镜头构图和生成视频前的空间验证。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-documentary\n      - generic: 将主题研究、采访与素材组织为事实可追溯的纪录片结构、旁白和镜头计划。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-dodge-game-video\n      - generic: 从角色参考图制作四向躲闪关键帧、游戏反馈和短时反应挑战视频。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-dotmatrix-brand-motion\n      - generic: 根据品牌标志、名称与标语设计点阵字形系统、横版品牌图和动态字效。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-dreamcore-space\n      - generic: 设计梦核、阈限空间与超现实后室场景，控制空间规则、情绪线索、镜头漫游和声音氛围。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-dual-player-intro\n      - generic: 根据两位玩家名称、角色参考和游戏世界观设计双人游戏菜单开场、选角确认与短视频生成方案。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-dynamic-poster\n      - generic: 将静态海报转为文字清晰、主体关系稳定且可循环的一镜到底动态海报。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-ecommerce-images\n      - generic: 从真实商品素材规划平台合规的电商主图、卖点图、场景图和细节图组。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-editor-export\n      - generic: 将时间线工程整理为可迁移的剪辑交付包，包含媒体、字幕、代理、命名与兼容性检查。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-education-video\n      - generic: 把知识目标转成讲解脚本、图解、示例、练习和理解验证，适合课程与科普视频。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-film-score\n      - generic: 为角色、场景和叙事段落设计主题动机、配器、速度、动态与音乐进出点。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-fpv-video\n      - generic: 设计连续沉浸的第一视角或 FPV 穿越路线、速度曲线、空间节点与一镜到底提示。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-h3-prompt-director\n      - generic: 把零散的视频目标、参考素材和限制整理成可控的多模态视频生成指令，适合 H3 类视频模型或兼容模型。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-image-inpaint\n      - generic: 根据遮罩或区域描述完成局部重绘，保持透视、光线、材质、边缘与未编辑区域稳定。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-image-remix\n      - generic: 从参考图提取构图、光线、材质与色彩关系，生成保持目标内容原创的新图方案。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-intentional-lowpoly-film\n      - generic: 将人物或场景转成有控制的早期低模、笨拙绑定和生硬运镜短片，同时保持主体可识别与审美一致。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: creative-koc-video\n      - generic: 为 KOC、口播和电商短视频设计开场钩子、自然脚本、镜头、B-roll 与平台版本。\n      - button \"安装\":\n        - text: 安装\n      - generic: